msgctxt "game_options"
msgid ""
"Adjust mixing of CD audio. In MSU-MD, cartridge-sourced sound effects are "
"not affected."
msgstr ""
"Úprava míchání zvuku CD. V MSU-MD nejsou zvukové efekty z kazet ovlivněny."

